The following should do it:

# creating Fortran DLLS using "mingw32" compiler
g77 -O2 -c test.f 
dllwrap -o test.dll --export-all-symbols test.o 
dyn.load("test.dll")   

Also, refer to Venables and Ripley's "S Programming" (Appendix A.4) for 
more details.

Ravi.

