Message-ID: <EDAC416B87ECCA44BEAB4D0CF48034EF4543E6@se2kexch01.insightful.com>

We looked into this problem, and tracked it down to the S_TMP environment
variable.  If this is set, summaryReport incorrectly adds the path *twice* to
the front of the filename you specify.

If S_TMP is set in your environment, a fix for summaryReport, and further
details about the problem, can be found here:
http://www.insightful.com/insightful_faq/dsp_article.asp?articleID=200

Thanks for reporting this!

